<title>USA: Quiksilver president Herrel resigns.</title>
<headline>Quiksilver president Herrel resigns.</headline>
<dateline>COSTA MESA, Calif. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects name of departing president throughout from Robert McKnight to Randall Herrel.)</p>
<p>Quiksilver Inc said Randall Herrel will resign as president, chief operating officer, and a director of the company, effective November 20.</p>
<p>The company did not name a replacement.</p>
<p>Herrel left to take over as president and chief executive of Ashworth Inc, a sportwear manufacturer.</p>
